1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,040
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:03,240
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:05,210
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:08,410
Hyun Jun, how could you?

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,950
I won't let you get away with this.
You and Oh Jung Ran.

6
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:18,560
I'm going to destroy you
with my own two hands.

7
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,290
Whatever it takes!

8
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,100
Mr. Park Tae Ho, we're moving
to the interrogation room.

9
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:27,770
Let's go.

10
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:31,670
You'd better be ready,
Park Hyun Jun.

11
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:34,270
You'd better be ready!

12
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:35,640
Was this confirmed from the start?

13
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:37,580
Is there confirmation
on what happened?

14
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:38,980
Please give us a comment.

15
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:40,680
What's going on?

16
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,210
Mr. Park Hyun Jun, please just
give us a comment.

17
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,260
He's not my son?

18
00:00:55,130 --> 00:00:56,290
He's not my son?

19
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,630
I was fooled by the likes of them?

20
00:01:00,970 --> 00:01:01,970
No...

21
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:04,340
I, Park Tae Ho,
would never be fooled like this.

22
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,780
Right. Kim Dan Hui.

23
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:13,810
You set this up too, didn't you?

24
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,480
Did you get Hyun Jun to pretend...

25
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:19,120
he wasn't my son?

26
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:22,550
Is this pathetic little stunt
what you call revenge?

27
00:01:24,790 --> 00:01:27,690
It was worth being patient
and not saying anything.

28
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:31,860
I'm glad you found out
in the most painful way possible.

29
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:33,500
Then...

30
00:01:35,630 --> 00:01:37,970
This is real?

31
00:01:40,170 --> 00:01:41,170
You...

32
00:01:42,670 --> 00:01:44,480
You knew this whole time?

33
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:45,880
Your whole life,

34
00:01:46,210 --> 00:01:47,510
you thought you held...

35
00:01:47,580 --> 00:01:49,450
everyone's weaknesses and secrets.

36
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:53,020
I'm sure you had fun
deceiving and using me...

37
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:54,850
for 30 long years.

38
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:56,450
But you,

39
00:01:57,220 --> 00:01:58,220
Park Tae Ho,

40
00:01:59,260 --> 00:02:02,230
have been deceived
by Oh Jung Ran's lies for 30 years,

41
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:03,760
and used by her this entire time.

42
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:07,270
How does it feel?

43
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:10,070
Now can you finally
begin to understand...

44
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:12,540
the despair and rage I've felt?

45
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:16,810
How dare... How dare you...

46
00:02:16,940 --> 00:02:19,580
You killed the mother
of your only son,

47
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:21,180
my sister.

48
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:29,090
You crushed your only son
and tore apart...

49
00:02:29,350 --> 00:02:30,760
the sacred bond
between parent and child.

50
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,800
And that's why...

51
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:41,470
you've ended up all alone.

52
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,210
I'm all alone?

53
00:02:47,310 --> 00:02:49,940
That's right. Just as you said,

54
00:02:50,380 --> 00:02:53,780
I suppose this too
is my form of revenge.

55
00:02:55,050 --> 00:02:56,980
I made you face
all the evil things you've done...

56
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:58,650
and all your regrets...

57
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:01,390
in the most painful way possible.

58
00:03:14,230 --> 00:03:16,100
Mr. Park Tae Ho, are you all right?

59
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:18,240
Mr. Park, pull yourself together.

60
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:20,170
- Mr. Park!
- Mr. Park!

61
00:03:23,210 --> 00:03:24,940
When did you decide on this?

62
00:03:27,510 --> 00:03:28,510
That day...

63
00:03:30,010 --> 00:03:31,320
at the holding cell.

64
00:03:33,350 --> 00:03:36,120
When I saw you locked up... Bang.

65
00:03:37,420 --> 00:03:39,560
It was like I got hit
on the back of the head.

66
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:43,830
I asked myself
what I had been doing,

67
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,730
and I was filled with regret.

68
00:03:46,970 --> 00:03:51,300
I was so ashamed
of being a chauffeur's son,

69
00:03:54,410 --> 00:03:55,940
that I became Park Tae Ho's son...

70
00:03:57,740 --> 00:03:59,940
and chairman of the Adele Group.

71
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,620
But even then, in front of you,

72
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,590
I was still ashamed.

73
00:04:08,890 --> 00:04:12,890
But you came back
with your head held high.

74
00:04:14,990 --> 00:04:16,090
You're right.

75
00:04:18,130 --> 00:04:19,760
Even I have to admit,

76
00:04:21,770 --> 00:04:23,230
I was pretty cool today.

77
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:30,610
"I resign
as chairman of Adele Group."

78
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,300
Are you still upset with me?

79
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,070
Why are you avoiding me?

80
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:06,140
I didn't want to interrupt you two.

81
00:05:09,750 --> 00:05:12,680
Where do I even begin?

82
00:05:17,060 --> 00:05:18,690
I acted like such a fool.

83
00:05:20,260 --> 00:05:21,630
I'm sorry for everything.

84
00:05:21,730 --> 00:05:23,390
I know things weren't easy for you.

85
00:05:24,660 --> 00:05:27,730
I'm just glad
that the Park Hyun Jun I know...

86
00:05:29,170 --> 00:05:30,200
is finally back.

87
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,710
Jin Ju was really worried about you
this whole time.

88
00:05:37,310 --> 00:05:40,750
Instead of saying sorry,
stay by her side...

89
00:05:41,550 --> 00:05:43,550
and show her
that you're being yourself again.

90
00:05:47,350 --> 00:05:48,390
Just a second.

91
00:05:50,350 --> 00:05:52,220
(Driver Song)

92
00:05:52,290 --> 00:05:53,590
Is your phone off?

93
00:05:54,090 --> 00:05:56,890
Yes, I was getting too many calls
about what happened earlier.

94
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,360
It looks like
Driver Song is trying to reach you.

95
00:05:59,730 --> 00:06:00,930
You should call him.

96
00:06:01,270 --> 00:06:02,270
Right.

97
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:08,610
He's been worried sick about you.

98
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,310
Later, Hyun Jun.

99
00:06:26,990 --> 00:06:28,060
Hyun Jun.

100
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:32,830
It must've been tough
going through this alone.

101
00:06:36,130 --> 00:06:37,240
Where's Mom?

102
00:06:40,270 --> 00:06:42,370
Mom. Ms. Oh.

103
00:06:48,550 --> 00:06:49,580
Jung Ran!

104
00:06:49,710 --> 00:06:50,780
You...

105
00:06:51,250 --> 00:06:53,680
How could you do this? How?

106
00:06:54,550 --> 00:06:55,620
I'm sorry.

107
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:58,490
You tore my life to shreds
without a second thought for me,

108
00:06:58,690 --> 00:06:59,760
and you're sorry?

109
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:02,890
Is that all you have to say?

110
00:07:03,130 --> 00:07:04,560
Mom, please.

111
00:07:04,860 --> 00:07:05,860
That's right.

112
00:07:06,060 --> 00:07:08,270
From the moment
I became your mother,

113
00:07:09,030 --> 00:07:10,670
you were my entire world.

114
00:07:12,100 --> 00:07:15,040
To make you the head
of the Adele Group,

115
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:17,810
I fought Kim Dan Hui for 30 years,

116
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:20,510
I tried to kill Park Min Jun
and Baek Jin Ju,

117
00:07:21,210 --> 00:07:22,810
and I even took care
of Deputy Chief Yun...

118
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:24,450
who was blackmailing us
with your secret.

119
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:29,050
I was a nervous wreck,
terrified your secret would get out.

120
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:31,460
And while it was eating me alive,

121
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:35,560
I made you Chairman Park Hyun Jun.

122
00:07:36,460 --> 00:07:37,500
But you...

123
00:07:37,860 --> 00:07:39,230
All my hard work...

124
00:07:39,300 --> 00:07:40,300
and all those years!

125
00:07:41,070 --> 00:07:43,370
You just threw my whole life away.

126
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,310
How can a son be
so thoughtless and cruel?

127
00:07:51,810 --> 00:07:52,810
I'm sorry.

128
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,080
Jung Ran.

129
00:07:57,150 --> 00:07:59,880
This couldn't have been
an easy decision for Hyun Jun.

130
00:08:00,250 --> 00:08:02,820
He knew that this wasn't his place,

131
00:08:02,890 --> 00:08:04,920
and it wasn't the life he wanted.

132
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:08,690
He must've agonized
over this decision.

133
00:08:09,490 --> 00:08:11,730
Maybe be more understanding...

134
00:08:11,730 --> 00:08:12,930
Shut it!

135
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,070
Mom!

136
00:08:14,630 --> 00:08:18,270
This is your fault.
You whispered in his ear.

137
00:08:18,370 --> 00:08:19,640
You told him to quit,

138
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:22,710
that being chairman is meaningless,
filling his head with nonsense.

139
00:08:22,810 --> 00:08:23,880
Sure.

140
00:08:24,210 --> 00:08:25,480
It's my fault.

141
00:08:25,940 --> 00:08:28,150
You can hit me as much as you want
until you feel better.

142
00:08:29,850 --> 00:08:32,650
I'll take it all for Hyun Jun.

143
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,390
But...

144
00:08:36,390 --> 00:08:37,720
to our Hyun Jun,

145
00:08:38,890 --> 00:08:39,960
I'm going to tell him...

146
00:08:42,260 --> 00:08:44,400
he did great
and that I'm proud of him.

147
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:46,300
Stop it.

148
00:08:48,530 --> 00:08:50,740
This was my choice.

149
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:55,140
Is this really what you want?

150
00:08:56,170 --> 00:08:59,310
Now you want to be looked down on
as a chauffeur's son?

151
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,680
Is that the life you want?

152
00:09:01,910 --> 00:09:03,080
Yes.

153
00:09:05,180 --> 00:09:07,320
I figured that would be better.

154
00:09:08,990 --> 00:09:09,990
What?

155
00:09:11,260 --> 00:09:13,120
If other people look down on me,

156
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:16,330
I can just ignore them. But...

157
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:21,670
If I see myself as pathetic,
how am I supposed to go on?

158
00:09:22,230 --> 00:09:26,300
What's the point of being chairman
if I can't even hold my head high?

159
00:09:29,740 --> 00:09:31,280
I'm sorry, Mom,

160
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,050
but what I did today...

161
00:09:38,150 --> 00:09:39,380
I don't regret it.

162
00:09:49,090 --> 00:09:50,090
Hyun Jun.

163
00:09:55,030 --> 00:09:56,900
Then what about me?

164
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,970
How am I supposed to live?

165
00:10:01,470 --> 00:10:05,310
And how are we going to survive
Park Tae Ho's wrath?

166
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:18,190
Who would've thought Park Hyun Jun
would expose his own secret?

167
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:19,560
I know, right?

168
00:10:19,620 --> 00:10:21,530
And his timing
was absolutely perfect.

169
00:10:22,430 --> 00:10:23,790
Park Hyun Jun...

170
00:10:24,330 --> 00:10:26,360
made a really brave decision.

171
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:27,630
I know.

172
00:10:27,830 --> 00:10:31,340
I'm relieved
he stood up for himself.

173
00:10:31,340 --> 00:10:32,340
Right.

174
00:10:32,370 --> 00:10:35,310
And I heard he received
all of Park Tae Ho's assets, too.

175
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:39,640
There's nothing left
in Park Tae Ho's hands now.

176
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:44,150
He can no longer use the law,
or escape the consequences.

177
00:10:46,180 --> 00:10:48,450
How long have we waited
for this day?

178
00:10:49,220 --> 00:10:52,760
Our Dan Hui can finally relax
and smile now.

179
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:01,930
Why?
Is something still bothering you?

180
00:11:04,370 --> 00:11:05,370
Yes.

181
00:11:05,970 --> 00:11:08,040
I hope I'm overthinking this,

182
00:11:08,570 --> 00:11:13,640
but I'm worried about
what Park Tae Ho might be plotting.

183
00:11:14,780 --> 00:11:15,810
That's true.

184
00:11:16,850 --> 00:11:19,180
We've fallen
for his tricks countless times.

185
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:23,020
But isn't it different this time?

186
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,560
She's right.

187
00:11:28,490 --> 00:11:31,260
He'll be arrested
right after the interrogation,

188
00:11:31,330 --> 00:11:32,760
so don't worry too much.

189
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:34,700
Okay.

190
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:40,500
He'll definitely be arrested
this time, right?

191
00:11:40,570 --> 00:11:42,040
(Oh Jung Ran)

192
00:11:52,220 --> 00:11:53,980
Embezzlement and breach of trust
under the Act...

193
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:55,790
on the Aggravated Punishment
of Specific Economic Crimes,

194
00:11:56,920 --> 00:11:59,060
political and corporate bribery,

195
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:04,530
soliciting Yun Hyeong Su to stop
the Temi Bio reinvestigation,

196
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:08,430
coercing CEO Choi Sam Sik
to give false testimony,

197
00:12:08,500 --> 00:12:11,270
and ordering the murder of CEO Baek Jun Gi
through Choi Yu Na.

198
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:14,810
Seriously.
The list of charges is endless.

199
00:12:15,810 --> 00:12:17,510
If you continue to remain silent,

200
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:19,480
we'll have no choice
but to hold a cross-examination.

201
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:21,550
Shall we call in Choi Yu Na...

202
00:12:21,710 --> 00:12:23,410
and start with the incident
from seven years ago?

203
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:26,250
Get Oh Jung Ran.

204
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:28,420
Family visits aren't allowed
during an investigation.

205
00:12:28,490 --> 00:12:30,590
You said you wanted
a cross-examination.

206
00:12:32,190 --> 00:12:35,330
Oh Jung Ran was also involved
in creating my slush fund.

207
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:37,930
So instead of Choi Yu Na,

208
00:12:40,430 --> 00:12:42,830
Oh Jung Ran
should be questioned first.

209
00:12:48,770 --> 00:12:51,380
Park Tae Ho
will be arrested right away, right?

210
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:54,040
Please don't tell me
they'll let him go home.

211
00:12:54,110 --> 00:12:55,110
That's right.

212
00:12:55,250 --> 00:12:58,120
He'll be arrested as soon as
the interrogation is over.

213
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:03,590
What is it?

214
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:05,720
Are you gloating just because...

215
00:13:06,220 --> 00:13:08,290
I lost Adele Group
and Hyun Jun's secret is out?

216
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:12,200
You risked your whole life...

217
00:13:12,460 --> 00:13:14,600
to seize the chairmanship
at Adele Group...

218
00:13:15,730 --> 00:13:20,240
and silenced countless people
to protect a secret.

219
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:24,710
But the one who destroyed it all
was your own son.

220
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,480
It just made me realize...

221
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:29,210
how sad your life really is.

222
00:13:30,750 --> 00:13:33,680
Right. I'm already feeling sick,

223
00:13:33,950 --> 00:13:35,390
so don't you start.

224
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,250
Still, you should
consider yourself lucky.

225
00:13:37,450 --> 00:13:40,960
You were blinded by Adele Group
and ruined your life,

226
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:44,760
but Hyun Jun managed to save his
before it was too late.

227
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:48,030
Stop with your pointless greed...

228
00:13:48,230 --> 00:13:50,000
and protect his life for a change.

229
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:59,680
What is it? What now?

230
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:02,550
The search and seizure is over.

231
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:04,320
We have a statement
from Park Tae Ho...

232
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:07,320
alleging you helped create
the illegal slush fund.

233
00:14:08,190 --> 00:14:10,890
You've been summoned. Come with us.

234
00:14:10,890 --> 00:14:11,890
What?

235
00:14:12,860 --> 00:14:14,660
Park Tae Ho, that piece of trash.

236
00:14:16,830 --> 00:14:20,230
He's seeking revenge on me
over what happened with Hyun Jun.

237
00:14:22,470 --> 00:14:25,570
Because I deceived him for 30 years,
he'll want to eat me alive.

238
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:29,040
So, are you just going
to get scared and hide?

239
00:14:29,370 --> 00:14:30,440
If you're that worried,

240
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:32,610
you need to get Park Tae Ho arrested
as soon as possible.

241
00:14:33,410 --> 00:14:34,550
Go with them...

242
00:14:34,750 --> 00:14:36,880
and testify about
everything you know.

243
00:14:50,730 --> 00:14:51,860
Please come in.

244
00:15:06,680 --> 00:15:08,750
All right, let's begin
the questioning.

245
00:15:08,810 --> 00:15:11,780
Is it true that Park Hyun Jun
isn't my son?

246
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:16,620
Answer me.

247
00:15:18,290 --> 00:15:20,960
That's right. He isn't your son.

248
00:15:35,610 --> 00:15:36,940
Then whose is he?

249
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,680
It's all over anyway,
so what difference does it make?

250
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,450
It's none of your business.

251
00:15:42,410 --> 00:15:43,510
Oh Jung Ran.

252
00:15:44,950 --> 00:15:47,250
How can you hold your head up
so high in front of me?

253
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,190
What have you done...

254
00:15:50,550 --> 00:15:52,420
that gives you the right
to be so shameless?

255
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:54,660
Because I have nothing
to be sorry for.

256
00:15:56,190 --> 00:15:58,530
You were the one
who betrayed me first.

257
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:02,670
Besides, you never
even loved Hyun Jun.

258
00:16:03,930 --> 00:16:06,500
From the very beginning,
you compared him to Park Min Jun...

259
00:16:06,570 --> 00:16:08,170
and only cared about that brat.

260
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,440
Are you really so shocked
that he's not your son?

261
00:16:11,310 --> 00:16:13,780
Neither Park Hyun Jun
nor you, Oh Jung Ran,

262
00:16:15,110 --> 00:16:17,680
have any right to act so proud
in front of me.

263
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:21,520
I'm Park Tae Ho, and you can't
disrespect me like this!

264
00:16:22,420 --> 00:16:23,720
Just you wait.

265
00:16:24,190 --> 00:16:25,860
I'll teach you the consequences...

266
00:16:27,260 --> 00:16:30,360
of deceiving and disrespecting me.

267
00:16:30,890 --> 00:16:32,530
Consequences?

268
00:16:33,130 --> 00:16:35,900
What are you going to do?

269
00:16:38,500 --> 00:16:40,700
If you lay a finger on Hyun Jun,

270
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:42,610
there's nothing I won't do.

271
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:49,980
All right.
Save the family drama for later.

272
00:16:50,550 --> 00:16:52,850
- We'll question Choi Yu Na...
- Oh Jung Ran!

273
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,050
This is all your fault.

274
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:57,050
You pushed me
to kill Deputy Chief Yun,

275
00:16:57,050 --> 00:16:58,360
and then you set me up.

276
00:16:59,820 --> 00:17:02,660
What a pain.
Why are you on my case too?

277
00:17:03,190 --> 00:17:05,100
Do you have any proof
I ordered you to do it?

278
00:17:06,330 --> 00:17:07,400
I'm the proof.

279
00:17:08,100 --> 00:17:09,730
You people made me this way.

280
00:17:09,730 --> 00:17:12,400
Park Tae Ho, Oh Jung Ran,
you're the ones who ordered this.

281
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,850
Wait, what's this?

282
00:17:29,390 --> 00:17:31,320
Stay out
of the customers' conversation.

283
00:17:32,360 --> 00:17:33,820
I'll serve them.

284
00:17:36,630 --> 00:17:37,900
Here are your drinks.

285
00:17:38,730 --> 00:17:40,960
- Enjoy.
- Thank you.

286
00:17:56,380 --> 00:17:57,850
What's this?

287
00:17:58,380 --> 00:18:02,090
It's a talisman I got
from a renowned shaman.

288
00:18:02,620 --> 00:18:03,690
They say that...

289
00:18:04,590 --> 00:18:07,930
it can make a man in his coffin
jump right back up.

290
00:18:10,090 --> 00:18:11,660
But why...

291
00:18:11,930 --> 00:18:14,770
I saw the news
about Park Tae Ho too.

292
00:18:15,670 --> 00:18:17,870
That Park Tae Ho is finished now,

293
00:18:18,670 --> 00:18:21,440
and all of Yu Na's crimes
will be revealed.

294
00:18:22,870 --> 00:18:26,010
Deputy Chief Yun needs to wake up...

295
00:18:26,710 --> 00:18:30,680
so she can at least avoid
the murder charge.

296
00:18:32,180 --> 00:18:34,720
Jin Ju. Could you...

297
00:18:35,290 --> 00:18:36,890
please put this...

298
00:18:36,950 --> 00:18:39,460
in his hospital room for me?

299
00:18:41,230 --> 00:18:43,130
Even though I'm her mother,

300
00:18:43,230 --> 00:18:44,760
this is the only thing I can do.

301
00:18:46,100 --> 00:18:48,370
Praying day and night...

302
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,070
that he lives...

303
00:18:50,430 --> 00:18:52,940
is the only thing I can do for her.

304
00:18:55,610 --> 00:18:58,510
Sure, I'll put it there.

305
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:02,880
Thank you, Jin Ju.
I'm truly grateful.

306
00:19:03,950 --> 00:19:04,950
If only Yu Na...

307
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:08,120
realized how much you care.

308
00:19:09,690 --> 00:19:13,220
Who can I blame? It's all my fault.

309
00:19:14,630 --> 00:19:18,130
It's my fault
for not raising Yu Na right.

310
00:19:26,670 --> 00:19:28,710
Thank you, Jin Ju.

311
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:37,210
First, let's look into...

312
00:19:37,210 --> 00:19:39,580
the solicitation
of Yun Hyeong Su's murder.

313
00:19:40,580 --> 00:19:43,950
Ms. Choi, you acted to protect
Park Hyun Jun's secret,

314
00:19:44,090 --> 00:19:47,990
and Mr. Park,
you acted to set up Baek Jin Ju,

315
00:19:48,060 --> 00:19:49,190
meaning you both conspired.

316
00:19:49,530 --> 00:19:51,560
You knew too?

317
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:55,430
That Park Hyun Jun isn't my son.

318
00:19:56,130 --> 00:19:57,900
Was I the only one who didn't know?

319
00:19:58,700 --> 00:19:59,940
I did nothing wrong.

320
00:20:00,170 --> 00:20:03,770
I was merely used and manipulated
by Chairman Park.

321
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:06,740
Are you saying
that Park Tae Ho gave the orders?

322
00:20:07,740 --> 00:20:11,010
Yes. He used me
from the very beginning.

323
00:20:11,150 --> 00:20:12,480
Seven years ago,

324
00:20:12,550 --> 00:20:14,420
you said it would just be
a minor car accident.

325
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:16,550
You didn't say you were going
to kill CEO Baek.

326
00:20:17,590 --> 00:20:18,760
If I had known...

327
00:20:19,890 --> 00:20:20,890
I...

328
00:20:21,690 --> 00:20:22,930
wouldn't have done it.

329
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:24,930
Things wouldn't have
turned out like this.

330
00:20:25,260 --> 00:20:28,000
Park Tae Ho, you ruined my life.

331
00:20:29,430 --> 00:20:32,070
You wouldn't have done it
if you'd known?

332
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,200
No.

333
00:20:35,210 --> 00:20:36,540
Choi Yu Na, you...

334
00:20:37,870 --> 00:20:39,640
You wanted this.

335
00:20:40,140 --> 00:20:42,250
You killed someone
for your own gain.

336
00:20:43,650 --> 00:20:44,650
That's not true.

337
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:46,920
How could you...

338
00:20:47,020 --> 00:20:49,050
protect Park Tae Ho,
the man who killed your father,

339
00:20:49,120 --> 00:20:52,360
and frame your innocent father
as a murderer?

340
00:20:52,620 --> 00:20:54,730
After killing your own father,

341
00:20:54,890 --> 00:20:58,060
how can you shamelessly pretend
to be a devoted daughter?

342
00:20:58,560 --> 00:21:00,300
I would've seen you differently.

343
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:01,730
I would've been grateful,

344
00:21:01,800 --> 00:21:04,970
and I wouldn't loathe you
the way I do now.

345
00:21:06,070 --> 00:21:08,510
No. It's not true.

346
00:21:08,870 --> 00:21:11,910
No way!

347
00:21:12,210 --> 00:21:13,210
Ms. Choi.

348
00:21:15,910 --> 00:21:17,110
Are you okay?

349
00:21:19,950 --> 00:21:22,520
That will be all
for your questioning today.

350
00:21:23,050 --> 00:21:25,190
Park Tae Ho,
until we request the arrest warrant,

351
00:21:25,260 --> 00:21:26,520
you are to wait here.

352
00:21:40,840 --> 00:21:42,810
What? What on earth?

353
00:21:42,940 --> 00:21:44,040
What's going on?

354
00:21:44,340 --> 00:21:45,610
What's wrong with you?

355
00:21:46,410 --> 00:21:50,280
Call an ambulance, quickly.
Mr. Park?

356
00:21:50,650 --> 00:21:51,720
Mr. Park!

357
00:21:52,750 --> 00:21:54,120
Park Tae Ho is gone?

358
00:21:54,790 --> 00:21:57,390
Yes, we got word
from the intel team.

359
00:21:58,090 --> 00:22:01,730
Apparently, Park Tae Ho escaped
before his warrant hearing.

360
00:22:01,990 --> 00:22:04,490
He collapsed during transfer
and was rushed to the hospital,

361
00:22:04,590 --> 00:22:06,230
but he went missing during testing.

362
00:22:07,700 --> 00:22:08,800
Park Tae Ho.

363
00:22:10,170 --> 00:22:13,170
He isn't the type to do something
this reckless without a plan.

364
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:17,910
If he escaped, he must have
something specific in mind.

365
00:22:18,010 --> 00:22:21,580
Given the situation, avoiding arrest
has to be his only reason.

366
00:22:21,650 --> 00:22:25,780
Yes, it's either to hide from arrest
or to flee the country.

367
00:22:26,420 --> 00:22:29,720
Park Tae Ho escaped?

368
00:22:36,630 --> 00:22:39,500
Did something happen
during the questioning yesterday?

369
00:22:40,460 --> 00:22:44,530
Are you afraid
you'll be dragged off to prison too?

370
00:22:45,870 --> 00:22:48,470
Not prison, but Park Tae Ho.

371
00:22:50,310 --> 00:22:51,910
That man had murder in his eyes.

372
00:22:52,840 --> 00:22:55,710
He looked as if he was going
to kill Hyun Jun and me.

373
00:22:55,950 --> 00:22:58,850
Why worry
when he'll be behind bars soon?

374
00:22:58,950 --> 00:23:01,820
He's committed so many crimes
that he won't get out easily.

375
00:23:08,560 --> 00:23:09,660
What is it this early?

376
00:23:10,260 --> 00:23:13,230
Was there anything unusual
during your questioning yesterday?

377
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:14,970
What are you talking about?

378
00:23:15,470 --> 00:23:18,400
Did Park Tae Ho have a plan
to skip the country?

379
00:23:18,900 --> 00:23:20,170
Flee the country?

380
00:23:20,600 --> 00:23:23,010
Park Tae Ho has been missing
since last night.

381
00:23:25,080 --> 00:23:26,910
Oh Jung Ran?

382
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:28,450
He...

383
00:23:29,410 --> 00:23:31,080
He escaped so he could kill us.

384
00:23:31,380 --> 00:23:33,180
Wait. Hyun Jun...

385
00:23:33,450 --> 00:23:36,050
Find Hyun Jun first. Right now!

386
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:42,560
What did Oh Jung Ran say?

387
00:23:43,360 --> 00:23:44,900
Did he have a plan
to flee the country?

388
00:23:45,630 --> 00:23:47,600
Oh Jung Ran's terrified.

389
00:23:48,230 --> 00:23:51,670
She thinks Park Tae Ho escaped
to kill her and Hyun Jun.

390
00:23:53,770 --> 00:23:57,110
So his motive for escaping
was not to flee the country,

391
00:23:57,870 --> 00:23:58,880
but revenge?

392
00:23:59,340 --> 00:24:02,050
In that case, we need to find
Park Tae Ho even faster.

393
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:04,350
Hyun Jun could be in danger.

394
00:24:05,280 --> 00:24:07,620
Jin Ju, you and Mother
need to be careful too.

395
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:17,530
Park Tae Ho,
what on earth are you planning?

396
00:24:20,130 --> 00:24:23,130
(876501)

397
00:24:25,800 --> 00:24:27,670
The Adele Group vault.

398
00:24:29,070 --> 00:24:30,070
This is the password.

399
00:24:31,440 --> 00:24:35,010
Tell the man you sent to the vault
to try opening the door.

400
00:24:39,780 --> 00:24:41,080
(Eunhwa Trading)

401
00:24:41,180 --> 00:24:42,290
The vault door is now open.

402
00:24:43,990 --> 00:24:46,820
There's no need to doubt me
about the paintings inside.

403
00:24:48,020 --> 00:24:50,130
They were collected in secret,

404
00:24:51,630 --> 00:24:55,000
and I left them out
when I transferred my assets.

405
00:24:57,730 --> 00:24:59,870
Right, the paintings
have been confirmed.

406
00:25:02,970 --> 00:25:04,040
Then, tell me.

407
00:25:04,810 --> 00:25:06,140
What can I do for you?

408
00:25:31,900 --> 00:25:34,100
The whereabouts
of Chairman Park Tae Ho,

409
00:25:34,170 --> 00:25:36,410
who escaped before
an arrest warrant could be filed,

410
00:25:36,470 --> 00:25:37,810
remain unknown for a fifth day.

411
00:25:38,540 --> 00:25:42,210
Authorities are tracking him
following leads that he fled abroad,

412
00:25:42,650 --> 00:25:45,180
but they suspect he's already
entered a country illegally,

413
00:25:45,180 --> 00:25:46,850
which makes locating him difficult.

414
00:25:52,660 --> 00:25:54,090
Did you lock up properly?

415
00:25:54,620 --> 00:25:56,360
Did you block
the secret entrance you used?

416
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:57,760
Of course I did.

417
00:25:58,030 --> 00:26:00,560
Stop worrying and take a breath.

418
00:26:01,060 --> 00:26:03,300
There's been no word
from Park Tae Ho for days,

419
00:26:03,370 --> 00:26:04,570
and not a single trace of him.

420
00:26:04,570 --> 00:26:06,570
I'm telling you, he fled overseas.

421
00:26:07,570 --> 00:26:08,570
What about Hyun Jun?

422
00:26:18,250 --> 00:26:19,950
You spend all day
worrying about him.

423
00:26:20,320 --> 00:26:22,120
It's time to forgive him.

424
00:26:22,690 --> 00:26:24,390
If he feels at all guilty
for what he did to me,

425
00:26:24,590 --> 00:26:26,260
tell him to stay home.

426
00:26:26,690 --> 00:26:28,430
Are you going to stay
cooped up in here forever?

427
00:26:29,730 --> 00:26:30,860
We still have things to do.

428
00:26:32,560 --> 00:26:34,130
As in what?

429
00:26:35,030 --> 00:26:36,030
Right.

430
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:38,000
I have a meeting with the lawyers.

431
00:26:38,540 --> 00:26:42,170
You're going to be questioned
again soon, so we need to prepare.

432
00:26:42,670 --> 00:26:44,610
There are other things
I need to handle too.

433
00:26:46,010 --> 00:26:47,010
I'll see you later.

434
00:26:50,080 --> 00:26:51,180
Hey, Park Hyun Jun!

435
00:26:57,890 --> 00:27:00,990
Is there still no news
about Park Tae Ho?

436
00:27:01,360 --> 00:27:02,430
I'm afraid so.

437
00:27:02,430 --> 00:27:06,100
Both police and prosecutors say
he isn't easy to track.

438
00:27:06,900 --> 00:27:10,170
It seems he's already been smuggled
out of the country.

439
00:27:11,970 --> 00:27:15,070
We can't let Park Tae Ho get away.

440
00:27:16,470 --> 00:27:20,210
I'll send people abroad if necessary
and find him.

441
00:27:20,380 --> 00:27:21,880
Everyone's looking for him,

442
00:27:23,080 --> 00:27:26,320
so let's wait until a lead turns up.

443
00:27:27,180 --> 00:27:28,320
By the way,

444
00:27:28,320 --> 00:27:31,920
I heard there's a press conference
at Adele Group today.

445
00:27:32,520 --> 00:27:34,290
Yes. Hyun Jun will announce...

446
00:27:34,290 --> 00:27:36,330
that Park Tae Ho's
remaining shares and assets...

447
00:27:36,590 --> 00:27:39,730
will be donated to society
via the welfare foundation.

448
00:27:40,700 --> 00:27:43,700
Are all of you going to attend?

449
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:49,070
Yes. It seems like too much
for Hyun Jun to handle on his own.

450
00:27:50,310 --> 00:27:53,380
Min Jun is already there
helping him.

451
00:27:54,210 --> 00:27:56,380
Actually, there's one more thing.

452
00:27:56,610 --> 00:27:58,420
Park Tae Ho's former assets...

453
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,850
will be donated
under the name of Munhwadang.

454
00:28:02,620 --> 00:28:04,090
Under the name of Munhwadang?

455
00:28:04,790 --> 00:28:09,430
Yes. You see, I've already
told Hyun Jun your story.

456
00:28:35,120 --> 00:28:38,990
Will this be enough to apologize
to the people of Munhwadang?

457
00:28:40,420 --> 00:28:41,960
Compared to what my mom did,

458
00:28:43,190 --> 00:28:44,530
this is probably nothing.

459
00:28:45,630 --> 00:28:47,200
You have to start somewhere.

460
00:28:47,760 --> 00:28:50,670
You're taking the first step
on your mother's behalf.

461
00:28:52,140 --> 00:28:54,740
I've posted security guards
just in case.

462
00:28:55,110 --> 00:28:58,110
Be careful
since Park Tae Ho might show up.

463
00:28:58,510 --> 00:28:59,510
Right.

464
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:03,050
We might find out today
if he really fled the country.

465
00:29:03,950 --> 00:29:05,220
If he's hiding in the country,

466
00:29:05,480 --> 00:29:08,920
he won't just watch as the assets
he gave to me, his fake son,

467
00:29:09,890 --> 00:29:13,090
get donated in the name
of Munhwadang.

468
00:29:18,500 --> 00:29:19,500
Shall we begin?

469
00:29:29,870 --> 00:29:31,010
(Adele)

470
00:29:36,810 --> 00:29:37,850
Good day.

471
00:29:38,350 --> 00:29:41,620
I'm here today to announce
what I plan to do...

472
00:29:42,190 --> 00:29:43,350
with the shares and assets...

473
00:29:44,090 --> 00:29:46,790
gifted to me
by former Chairman Park Tae Ho.

474
00:29:47,460 --> 00:29:51,230
I'll be donating everything
I have received to society...

475
00:29:55,100 --> 00:29:56,300
via the welfare foundation.

476
00:30:10,980 --> 00:30:14,180
No way. Our Hyun Jun looks
even more handsome on screen.

477
00:30:15,620 --> 00:30:19,520
Donating all those shares and assets
to a good cause.

478
00:30:19,860 --> 00:30:21,660
How admirable.

479
00:30:22,230 --> 00:30:23,390
What are you talking about?

480
00:30:28,230 --> 00:30:30,830
What's this about shares and assets?

481
00:30:34,540 --> 00:30:37,140
Jung Ran, calm down, okay?

482
00:30:43,810 --> 00:30:45,580
The press conference went smoothly.

483
00:30:47,050 --> 00:30:48,350
This pretty much confirms it.

484
00:30:49,190 --> 00:30:50,290
Park Tae Ho...

485
00:30:51,390 --> 00:30:52,420
has fled the country.

486
00:30:53,320 --> 00:30:54,320
Right.

487
00:30:54,920 --> 00:30:58,030
I should meet with my mother
and Jin Ju to discuss this.

488
00:30:58,600 --> 00:31:01,300
If he really did flee the country,
we need to come up with a plan.

489
00:31:04,500 --> 00:31:06,340
(Ms. Oh)

490
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:08,610
It's Ms. Oh.

491
00:31:09,540 --> 00:31:12,040
I bet she's losing it
after watching the press conference.

492
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:16,580
I'd better go smooth things over.

493
00:31:18,950 --> 00:31:19,950
Thanks for today.

494
00:31:21,380 --> 00:31:22,390
You should go.

495
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:24,720
I'll get going.

496
00:31:43,970 --> 00:31:44,970
Park Hyun Jun.

497
00:31:51,150 --> 00:31:52,580
Park Hyun Jun!

498
00:31:53,420 --> 00:31:55,250
You!

499
00:32:36,090 --> 00:32:38,090
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
